    "description": "Retrieve the conversation history of the current chat, scoped to the current agent: only messages this agent sent or received are returned, so a chat shared with other agents never exposes exchanges it was not part of. Each message carries its id, message_type, sender and receiver names/types, content and timestamp. Tool cards and internal flow rows are excluded by default because they are debug scaffolding containing large audit payloads; pass include_debug=true only if those are specifically needed. Results are paginated, and can be filtered with a free-text search over message content.",
